        "filing_date": "2025-11-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We continue to use our substantial engineering resources and expertise to develop new technologies, applications and services and make them available to licensees to help grow the wireless communications industry and generate new or expanded licensing opportunities.",
