        "filing_date": "2025-11-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "For 40 years, we have been a leader in helping set industry standards and creating era-defining technology breakthroughs, and we continue to play a leading role in developing system-level inventions that serve as the foundation for multiple generations of advanced wireless technologies.",
